OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders asked for views on      
OL,4,Aonline safety policy                   
OL,6,FIslanders are being encouraged to share
OL,7,Ftheir views about the future of        
OL,8,FGuernsey's online safety policy.       
OL,10,FThe UK Government announced plans to   
OL,11,Fadd provisions to the online safety act
OL,12,Fthat would ban social media platforms  
OL,13,Ffor under-16s from March 2027.         
OL,15,FThe Bailiwick of Guernsey is not       
OL,16,Fincluded in the plans but the Policy   
OL,17,Fand Resources Committee is exploring   
OL,18,Fwhether the act, or parts of it, might 
OL,19,Fbe extended to the island.             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
