OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders asked for views on      
OL,4,Aonline safety policy                   
OL,6,FDeputy Lindsay de Sausmarez, P&R       
OL,7,FPresident, said the islands' position  
OL,8,Fneeded to be sought promptly on whether
OL,9,Fislanders would want to be included,   
OL,10,Fparticularly the thoughts of young     
OL,11,Fpeople who would be directly affected. 
